msgid ""
"\n"
"Welcome to the Begriff Bot! I'll help you learn new words in a foreign language.\n"
"\n"
"In a few steps we'll set up things and start.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"¡Bienvenido al Begriff Bot! Te ayudaré a aprender palabras en otro idioma.\n"
"\n"
"Vamos a configurarlo todo en unos pocos pasos y empezamos.\n"

msgid "Change studied language"
msgstr "Cambiar idioma de estudio"

msgid "Check a phrase for grammar mistakes"
msgstr "Corregir una frase"

msgid ""
"Here you rate your memorization. If you couldn't come up with an answer, or "
"your answer is wrong, press AGAIN, and the card will show up soon again. If "
"your answer is correct, press GOOD, and the card will be scheduled for "
"tomorrow or later."
msgstr ""
"Ahora, valora tu respuesta. Si no la sabías o te equivocaste, pulsa OTRA "
"VEZ para que la tarjeta vuelva a salir pronto. Si acertaste, pulsa BIEN y "
"se programará para mañana o más tarde."

msgid ""
"Here you see the question. Try to remember the answer. If you come up with "
"it, press ANSWER to check yourself. If you can't remember it for 10 seconds,"
" don't try too hard, press ANSWER and try to memorize the answer."
msgstr ""
"Aquí tienes la pregunta. Intenta recordar la respuesta. Cuando creas "
"saberla, pulsa VER RESPUESTA para comprobar. Si no la recuerdas en 10 "
"segundos, no te fuerces; pulsa VER RESPUESTA y memoriza la solución."

msgid "📖 Study cards"
msgstr "📖 Estudiar tarjetas"

msgid ""
"Your current interface language is {language_name}{flag}. You can change it "
"or proceed."
msgstr ""
"El idioma actual de la interfaz es {language_name}{flag}. Puedes cambiarlo o "
"continuar."

msgid "Select other language"
msgstr "Seleccionar otro idioma"

msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Continuar"

msgid "Select your interface language:"
msgstr "Selecciona el idioma de la interfaz:"

msgid "Interface language set to {language}{flag}."
msgstr "La interfaz ahora está en {language}{flag}."

msgid "Select the language you want to study:"
msgstr "Selecciona el idioma que quieres estudiar:"

msgid "You now study {flag}{language}."
msgstr "Ahora estudias {flag}{language}."

msgid ""
"\n"
"Now that you've selected a language to study, we can begin.\n"
"\n"
"Imagine you're reading a book. Here's a paragraph:\n"
"\n"
"> {text}\n"
"\n"
"Pick one or two words you don't understand, write each on a new line, and send them to me. Watch what happens.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Ahora que has elegido un idioma para estudiar, podemos empezar.\n"
"\n"
"Imagina que estás leyendo un libro. Aquí tienes un párrafo:\n"
"\n"
"> {text}\n"
"\n"
"Elige una o dos palabras que no entiendas, escríbelas en líneas separadas y "
"envíamelas. Verás lo que pasa.\n"

msgid ""
"\n"
"So now you know what those words mean — and hopefully you understand the paragraph better. But will you still remember them in a week or two, or when you see them again in another text?\n"
"\n"
"To strengthen your memory, spend a few minutes each day reviewing the words you’ve looked up. Here's how it works:\n"
"\n"
"☝️ I’ll show you a word, and you try to recall its meaning.\n"
"\n"
"✌️ If you remember it, press \"ANSWER\" to check. Then rate your recall — I’ll schedule your next review accordingly.\n"
"\n"
"🖐 If you can’t recall it, press \"ANSWER\" anyway, read the explanation, and try to memorize it again.\n"
"\n"
"There’s solid science behind how this works — the better you remember a word, the less often you’ll see it. But if you're starting to forget it, I’ll make sure it comes up again.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Ahora sabes qué significan esas palabras y entiendes mejor el párrafo. Pero, "
"¿las recordarás dentro de una o dos semanas, o al verlas en otro texto?\n"
"\n"
"Para afianzar tu memoria, repasa cada día durante unos minutos las palabras "
"que has buscado. Funciona así:\n"
"\n"
"☝️ Te muestro una palabra y tú intentas recordar su significado.\n"
"\n"
"✌️ Si lo recuerdas, pulsa \"VER RESPUESTA\" para comprobar. Después, valora "
"tu respuesta y yo programaré el próximo repaso.\n"
"\n"
"🖐 Si no lo recuerdas, pulsa \"VER RESPUESTA\" igualmente, lee la "
"explicación e intenta memorizarla de nuevo.\n"
"\n"
"Hay mucha ciencia detrás de este método: cuanto mejor recuerdes una palabra, "
"menos la verás. Pero si empiezas a olvidarla, me encargaré de que te vuelva "
"a salir.\n"

msgid "ANSWER"
msgstr "VER RESPUESTA"

msgid "AGAIN"
msgstr "OTRA VEZ"

msgid "HARD"
msgstr "DIFÍCIL"

msgid "GOOD"
msgstr "BIEN"

msgid "EASY"
msgstr "FÁCIL"

msgid ""
"\n"
"You can start a study session anytime with the /study command. Practice regularly, and progress will follow in no time.\n"
"\n"
"Other useful commands to try:\n"
"\n"
"• `!!` — translates a phrase from {native_flag} to {studied_flag}.\n"
"\n"
"• `??` — clarifies tricky parts in {studied_flag}.\n"
"\n"
"• Send me a text longer than 30 characters — I’ll check it for mistakes.\n"
"\n"
"• Send me the URL of an article — I’ll summarize it for you, highlighting words you’re learning (try it on Wikipedia!).\n"
"\n"
"• Didn’t like my explanation? React with 👎 and I’ll redo it.\n"
"\n"
"• Need a usage example? React with 🙏 and I’ll give you one.\n"
"\n"
"You can open the cheatsheet anytime with the /help command.\n"
"            \n"
"Good luck!\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Puedes empezar una sesión de estudio cuando quieras con el comando /study. "
"Practica con regularidad y no tardarás en progresar.\n"
"\n"
"Otros comandos útiles:\n"
"\n"
"• `!!` — traduce una frase de {native_flag} a {studied_flag}.\n"
"\n"
"• `??` — aclara dudas sobre {studied_flag}.\n"
"\n"
"• Envíame un texto de más de 30 caracteres y lo corregiré.\n"
"\n"
"• Envíame la URL de un artículo y te lo resumiré, resaltando palabras que "
"estás aprendiendo (¡pruébalo con Wikipedia!).\n"
"\n"
"• ¿No te ha gustado mi explicación? Reacciona con 👎 y la reformularé.\n"
"\n"
"• ¿Necesitas un ejemplo de uso? Reacciona con 🙏 y te daré uno.\n"
"\n"
"Puedes ver esta guía de comandos cuando quieras con /help.\n"
"            \n"
"¡Mucha suerte!\n"

msgid ""
"\n"
"Welcome to Begriff Bot!\n"
"I’m here to help you learn and explore new words in a foreign language.\n"
"\n"
"Here’s what you can do:\n"
"\n"
"📝 Add words to your study list — Just send a list of words (one per line), and I’ll explain them automatically.\n"
"🗣️ Check a sentence — Send a sentence (30+ characters) to get feedback on grammar and word choice.\n"
"🔤 Translate or clarify —\n"
"    Start your message with !! to translate from your native language to the one you're studying.\n"
"    Use ?? to ask for clarification on something confusing.\n"
"\n"
"💬 React to my replies:\n"
"    🤔 for help with your options\n"
"    🙏 to get more details or examples\n"
"    👎 if you didn’t like the answer — I’ll try again\n"
"\n"
"🌐 Share a URL — Paste a link to get a summary in your target language, using words you’ve been learning.\n"
"\n"
"📜 /list — View your saved words and their details\n"
"📚 /study — Begin a study session with your words\n"
"📚 /check — Another way to check a sentence for grammar\n"
"🌍 /language — Change the language you're learning\n"
"🚀 /start — Launch the tutorial and setup\n"
"❓ /help — See this command guide anytime\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"¡Bienvenido al Begriff Bot!\n"
"Estoy aquí para ayudarte a aprender y explorar palabras en otro idioma.\n"
"\n"
"Esto es lo que puedes hacer:\n"
"\n"
"📝 Añadir palabras a tu lista — Envía una lista de palabras (una por línea) "
"y te las explicaré.\n"
"🗣️ Corregir una frase — Envía una frase (de más de 30 caracteres) para "
"recibir correcciones de gramática y vocabulario.\n"
"🔤 Traducir o aclarar —\n"
"    Empieza tu mensaje con !! para traducir de tu idioma al que estudias.\n"
"    Usa ?? para pedir que aclare algo que no entiendas.\n"
"\n"
"💬 Reacciona a mis respuestas:\n"
"    🤔 para obtener ayuda con tus opciones\n"
"    🙏 para pedir más detalles o ejemplos\n"
"    👎 si no te gustó la respuesta — lo intentaré de nuevo\n"
"\n"
"🌐 Compartir una URL — Pega un enlace para obtener un resumen en el idioma "
"que estudias, usando palabras que estás aprendiendo.\n"
"\n"
"📜 /list — Ver tus palabras guardadas y sus detalles\n"
"📚 /study — Empezar una sesión de estudio\n"
"📚 /check — Otra forma de corregir una frase\n"
"🌍 /language — Cambiar tu idioma de estudio\n"
"🚀 /start — Iniciar el tutorial y la configuración\n"
"❓ /help — Ver esta guía de comandos\n"

msgid ""
"\n"
"Use this command to delete a note or other object shown in a message.\n"
"\n"
"As an example:\n"
"1. you asked me for a word translation\n"
"2. I send it to you and add a note to study\n"
"3. you don't want to study it: send /delete as a reply to my message.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Usa este comando para eliminar una nota u otro elemento de un mensaje.\n"
"\n"
"Por ejemplo:\n"
"1. Me pides la traducción de una palabra.\n"
"2. Te la envío y la añado a tu lista de estudio.\n"
"3. Si no quieres estudiarla, responde a mi mensaje con /delete.\n"
"        "
